---
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ledger } from '../lib/data.ts';
import { dmy } from '../lib/view.ts';
import { CONTACT } from '../lib/site.ts';
const L=ledger();
---
<Base title="About" description="How the public paper portfolio works, who runs Rulebook, and where its prices and charts come from.">
<div class="wrap prose reader-intro about-story"><PageIntro title="About" summary="Rulebook lets you follow an investing decision from the rule that picked a stock to the price that closed it. The portfolio is simulated. Losses stay on the record.">Rulebook · paper investing</PageIntro>
<section><h2>Follow a decision</h2><ol class="about-steps"><li><a href="/calls/#screens">See what passed</a><p>Four published screens test stocks against different rules. If nothing qualifies, the money stays in cash.</p></li><li><a href="/calls/#record">Check what happened</a><p>Inspect entries, exits and costs in the public book. A short record cannot tell you whether a method works over time.</p></li><li><a href="/practice/">Try your own rules</a><p>Practise a trade with a risk limit or write a monthly plan. There is no broker connection.</p></li></ol></section>
<section id="sources"><h2>Where the numbers come from</h2><p>Ledger close: <strong>{dmy(L.as_of)}</strong>. Build date: {L.built_on ? dmy(L.built_on.slice(0,10)) : 'unavailable'}. Daily screens use closing data; delayed, unofficial quotes can be from a different session.</p><p><a href="/method/#price-basis">Read the price and accounting method</a>.</p><details><summary>Charts and sources</summary><p>Stock charts use dated price history from Yahoo Finance via our server. The public equity curve uses TradingView Lightweight Charts™; the practice journal uses uPlot. Neither chart library supplies the prices.</p></details></section>
<section><h2>What stays on your device</h2><p>Your plan, practice trades and watchlist stay in this browser. Clearing site data removes them and resets the Gate’s lock. Download your records before switching devices.</p><details><summary>Why practise with limits?</summary><p><a href="https://www.sebi.gov.in/media-and-notifications/press-releases/sep-2024/updated-sebi-study-reveals-93-of-individual-traders-incurred-losses-in-equity-fando-between-fy22-and-fy24-aggregate-losses-exceed-1-8-lakh-crores-over-three-years_86906.html">SEBI’s study published on 23 September 2024</a> found that 93% of individual equity derivatives traders lost money in FY22–FY24. The Gate lets you rehearse setting a limit before a trade; it cannot prevent real losses.</p></details><p>Email signup is separate. See <a href="/privacy/">what we store and how to request removal</a>.</p></section>
<section id="contact"><h2>Who runs Rulebook</h2><p>Akshay Kothari builds and runs Rulebook. To flag a number, include the page, symbol and date so it can be checked against the record.</p><p><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a> · <a href={CONTACT.site}>askakshay.com</a></p></section></div></Base>
